                </figcaption>
              </figure>

              <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-6">Fact table: the fire-protection standards in the lab container</h2>

              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Fire protection in the lab container works within a framework of building-control law, fire-protection standards, hazardous-substances law and workplace rules. The following overview is required reading for every fire-safety concept.
              </p>

              <div class="overflow-x-auto my-8">
